<!-- Rooms Details -->
<section class="rooms-details">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row">
			<div class="col col-md-5">
				
 
 
						<h1 class="section-heading a-up"			>
				ROOMS & SUITES					</h1>
							
 
 
						<div class="section-copy rooms-details__content a-up a-delay-1"			>
				<h6><span style="font-weight: 400;">Considered spaces that evoke comfort and relaxation.</span></h6>
<p>A stay at MOLLIE will be social and filled with adventure, yet it will offer an equal amount of respite. As one moves away from the lobby, there’s a soothing sense of quiet and calm. There’s an ever-present rhythm of light and dark spaces, inviting a cadence of slowing down. Our rooms are residential and considered, providing guests with an environment to rest deeply after long days of exploration. Learn more about our hotel rooms &amp; suites in Aspen below.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
					</div>
						</div>
			<div class="col col-md-7">
				
 
 
						<div class="rooms-details__amenities section-copy a-up a-delay-2"			>
				<h6>Room Amenities</h6>
<ul>
<li>L:A Bruket® luxury bath amenities</li>
<li>Parachute® 100% Egyptian cotton sheets</li>
<li>Complimentary Sightglass® coffee &amp; tea</li>
<li>Fellow® electric kettle</li>
<li>Kreafunk® aMAJOR Bluetooth speaker</li>
<li>55” UHDTV w/ Casting</li>
<li>Waterworks® bath fixtures &amp; rainfall shower</li>
<li>Parachute® Turkish cotton robes</li>
<li>Curated minibar</li>
<li>Maison Balzac® hand blown glassware</li>
<li>Steamery® Cirrus handheld steamer</li>
<li>Fiber broadband Wi-Fi</li>
</ul>
					</div>
						</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

