					</div>
					<div class="col col-md-6 rooms-block__content">
						
 
 
						<div class="section-copy a-up a-delay-1"			>
				<p>Our suites were crafted for both relaxation and connection. These spacious suites feature sitting areas, wet bars and expansive private terraces with views overlooking Paepcke Park and Red Mountain or Shadow Mountain. Linger over morning coffee on the terrace or invite friends over for evening cocktails.</p>
